# Wave T33 (Steamspring kit): steamfloor — Steamspring Town's
# registered street kind (the fleet's street kinds carry the
# -floor suffix; the desire-path tiers key on it). RUST
# FLAGSTONE: large irregular polygonal flags in rust-red
# volcanic stone, pale mineral grout, white crust flecks where
# the spring steam settles. Large irregular flags — unlike
# Cinder's regular brick courses, Cragmoor's small dark setts,
# Copperton's square quarry flags, Ashfall's fine swept drift.
# (NO-SAME-KIT law; WAVE-T33-STEAMSPRING-PLAN.md §5.)
